        <h2 id="senior-title">A soft companion dog solves a completely different problem</h2>
        <p>
          Chongker's plush companion robot dogs are designed around familiar pet-like interaction rather
          than coding, cameras or stunt features. The models we saw emphasised a soft body, voice interaction
          and heartbeat / purring-style feedback.
        </p>
